### ============================================================================
### AUDIOSCAPE NESTJS BACKEND API TEST SUITE (.http format)
### ============================================================================
### Usage: Open in VS Code with "REST Client" extension or use as curl reference.
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@googleIdToken = YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Root Endpoint Discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Health & Database Ping Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthcheck

### 3. Auth Module Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/status

### 4. Google Auth Sync (Requires valid Google ID Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "{{googleIdToken}}"
}

### 5. Protected Profile Check (Requires Bearer Google ID Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}

### 6. YouTube Music Search Proxy (With PostgreSQL 24h Caching)
GET {{baseUrl}}/youtube/search?query=lofi+hip+hop

### 7. YouTube Track Details Proxy (With PostgreSQL Cache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/youtube/track/dQw4w9WgXcQ

### 8. YouTube Category Lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/youtube/categories

### 9. Log Track Listen History (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/music/history
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "source": "SEARCH",
  "title": "Never Gonna Give You Up",
  "artist": "Rick Astley"
}

### 10. Get User Listen History (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/music/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}

### 11. Toggle Liked Favorite Track (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/music/like
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "liked": true
}

### 12. Get User Liked Favorites (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/music/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}

### 13. Create Custom Playlist (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Testing Playlist"
}

### 14. Get User Playlists (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{googleIdToken}}
